',en:'It’s so cozy, I want to sleep…'},{zh:'晚安预备…还没，再陪会儿。',en:'Almost goodnight… not yet, stay a bit.'},{zh:'困得连哈欠都偷懒了。',en:'So sleepy even my yawns are lazy.'},{zh:'头一点一点的，像啄米。',en:'My head keeps nodding off.'},{zh:'嘘…轻一点，要睡着啦。',en:'Shh… softly, I’m drifting off.'}],confused:[{zh:'咦…这是怎么回事呀？',en:'Huh… what’s going on here?'},{zh:'唔，我有点没跟上。',en:'Um, I didn’t quite follow.'},{zh:'等等，让我捋一捋…',en:'Wait, let me untangle this…'},{zh:'这个…要怎么弄来着？',en:'This… how does it work again?'},{zh:'脑袋上冒问号了。',en:'Question marks are popping over my head.'},{zh:'奇怪，刚刚还在的呀？',en:'Strange, it was just here?'},{zh:'你能再说一遍吗？',en:'Could you say that once more?'},{zh:'嗯…到底是哪个来着？',en:'Hmm… which one was it again?'},{zh:'我是不是漏看了什么？',en:'Did I miss something?'},{zh:'转了一圈，更糊涂了。',en:'Went in a circle and got more confused.'},{zh:'诶？左右我又搞反了。',en:'Huh? Mixed up left and right again.'},{zh:'这道题…超纲了吧！',en:'This puzzle’s above my pay grade!'},{zh:'歪着头想了半天…',en:'Tilted my head and pondered ages…'},{zh:'总觉得哪里怪怪的。',en:'Something feels off, I can’t say what.'},{zh:'啊啦，线索断掉了。',en:'Oh dear, the trail’s gone cold.'},{zh:'给我点时间，再想想。',en:'Give me a sec, let me think.'}]};var GREET={morning:[{mood:'happy',zh:'早呀！起这么早，了不起哦~',en:'Morning! Up already? Impressive~'},{mood:'excited',zh:'早安！新的一天，冲鸭！',en:'Morning! New day — let’s gooo!'},{mood:'sleepy',zh:'唔…早上好，我还没睡醒呢。',en:'Mm… morning. Not quite awake yet.'}],noon:[{mood:'happy',zh:'中午啦，别假装很忙，快去吃饭！',en:'Noon already — stop pretending to be busy, go eat!'},{mood:'surprised',zh:'诶，已经晌午了？时间好快！',en:'Huh, midday already? Time flies!'},{mood:'confused',zh:'午饭…吃了没？我有点记不清。',en:'Lunch… did you eat? I lost track.'}],afternoon:[{mood:'excited',zh:'下午好~ 是不是又在摸鱼呀？',en:'Afternoon~ slacking off again, are we?'},{mood:'sleepy',zh:'下午最容易犯困，要不要小憩？',en:'Afternoons make me drowsy — a little nap?'},{mood:'happy',zh:'午后慢悠悠，最适合闲逛啦。',en:'Lazy afternoons are perfect for a wander.'}],evening:[{mood:'shy',zh:'晚上好，夜猫子说的就是你吧？',en:'Evening — night owl, that’s you, isn’t it?'},{mood:'happy',zh:'忙完一天